---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PlannerCTA from '../../components/PlannerCTA.astro';
import SelectSaunasButton from '../../components/SelectSaunasButton.astro';

const pinnacleUrl = 'https://selectsaunas.com/products/almost-heaven-pinnacle-morgan-4-person-classic-barrel-sauna-6x6-ft';
---
<Base
  title="Almost Heaven Pinnacle Review: Specs, Costs, and Buyer Checklist"
  description="A source-backed Almost Heaven Pinnacle buyer guide covering current dimensions, electrical needs, installation planning, warranty, limitations, and questions to ask before ordering."
  canonical="/reviews/almost-heaven-pinnacle-review"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-amber-700 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Product research</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        Almost Heaven Pinnacle: a buyer's review before you order
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm">Reviewed August 15, 2026 · 9 min read</p>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-6 text-sm text-stone-700">
      <strong>Research scope:</strong> This is a desk-researched buyer guide, not a hands-on test. We checked the current manufacturer listing, construction manual, warranty language, and an authorized retailer listing. We have not assembled or measured this unit ourselves.
    </div>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2">The short answer</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-700">The Pinnacle belongs on the shortlist for buyers who want a compact, USA-made cedar barrel kit and can prepare a level base plus a dedicated 240V circuit. It is a weaker fit if you expect four adults to lounge comfortably, need an insulated cabin for severe weather, or want a turnkey price that already includes every site and electrical cost.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-9">
      <SelectSaunasButton href={pinnacleUrl} label="View current Pinnacle listing" ctaPosition="review_intro" />
      <a href="/sauna-planner/?ref=pinnacle_review&campaign=planner_first_10&placement=pinnacle_review" class="inline-block border border-stone-300 text-stone-800 font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-stone-50 transition-colors" data-track-event="planner_cta_clicked" data-cta-position="pinnacle_review">Plan the full project first</a>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-stone-900">Current published specifications</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-5">These figures come from Almost Heaven's current product page. Confirm them again on the exact configuration and manual attached to your order.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-8 text-sm">
      {[
        ['Published capacity', 'Up to four people'],
        ['Assembled size', '78 in. W x 71 in. D x 81.5 in. H'],
        ['Interior room', '75.25 in. W x 63.25 in. D x 69.25 in. H'],
        ['Bench size', '16 in. W x 63.25 in. L x 17 in. H'],
        ['Wall lumber', '1.375 in. ball-and-socket lumber'],
        ['Heater specification', '6kW, 240V, 30A, hardwired'],
        ['Lighting service', '120V, 15A, plug-in'],
        ['Published lead time', '6-8 weeks before shipment'],
      ].map(([label, value]) => (
        <div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-4">
          <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs uppercase font-semibold mb-1">{label}</p>
          <p class="font-medium text-stone-900">{value}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-stone-900">What the capacity label does not tell you</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">"Four person" is a maximum-capacity label. The published benches are 63.25 inches long and 16 inches wide. That measurement is more useful than the label when you decide whether people will sit shoulder to shoulder or whether one person can lie down.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">Mark the bench length on a wall or floor before ordering. If the intended users are tall, want to recline, or need more personal space, compare a longer model rather than assuming the stated capacity will feel roomy.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-stone-900">What is included, and what still needs planning</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">Almost Heaven currently lists tempered glass, stainless steel bands and fasteners, an interior LED light, and sauna stones among the product features. The configurator offers different doors, windows, finishes, and heater packages, so the final price and included equipment depend on the selected variant.</p>
    <div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-8">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3">Budget beyond the kit</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700">
        <li>A flat, load-appropriate foundation or platform.</li>
        <li>A licensed electrician for the exact heater manual, circuit, disconnect, and local code.</li>
        <li>Freight access, unloading, and movement from the delivery point to the pad.</li>
        <li>Assembly labor if you do not plan to build the kit yourself.</li>
        <li>Exterior protection and maintenance appropriate to the finish and climate.</li>
        <li>Permits or zoning review where your jurisdiction requires them.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-stone-900">Electrical and heater decision</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">The manufacturer currently specifies a 6kW heater configuration requiring 240V, 30A service and a hardwired connection. Do not turn that summary into a shopping list. The selected heater manual and local code determine conductor size, overcurrent protection, disconnect placement, controls, clearances, and any GFCI requirement.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">Send the exact heater model, manual, and planned cable route to the electrician before the sauna ships. This is the cleanest way to catch panel-capacity or trenching problems while there is still time to change the project.</p>
    <p class="mb-8"><a href="/guides/sauna-electrical-requirements/" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Use the sauna electrical planning checklist</a></p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-stone-900">Assembly and site preparation</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">Almost Heaven publishes a construction manual and describes most of its saunas as DIY-friendly. That does not establish a universal assembly time. Crew experience, foundation accuracy, delivery access, weather, and the selected doors or windows all change the job.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">Read the manual before preparing the base. Match the foundation to the current cradle layout, keep the sauna level, and leave access for band adjustment and exterior maintenance. For electrical work, follow the heater manual and use a qualified installer.</p>
    <p class="mb-8"><a href="/guides/sauna-foundation-guide/" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">Compare foundation options and questions</a></p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-stone-900">Warranty: read the two layers separately</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">Almost Heaven currently advertises a limited lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects on the sauna room. Its product page separately states a one-year warranty on Harvia heating elements and five years on other heater components. Coverage, exclusions, registration, labor, freight, and remedies matter more than the headline duration.</p>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-8">Save the warranty version, product configuration, serial information, invoice, and installation records that apply on the purchase date.</p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-stone-900">Questions to resolve before checkout</h2>
    <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 text-stone-700 mb-8">
      <li>Which lumber, door, window, finish, and heater are included in this exact price?</li>
      <li>What are the packed dimensions, freight method, unloading responsibility, and current lead time?</li>
      <li>Which current construction and heater manuals apply to the chosen configuration?</li>
      <li>Will the 63.25-inch benches work for the intended users?</li>
      <li>What foundation dimensions and drainage details does the current manual require?</li>
      <li>Which warranty exclusions apply to outdoor exposure, finish maintenance, installation, and electrical work?</li>
      <li>Who handles a damaged shipment or missing component, and how quickly must it be reported?</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="bg-stone-800 text-white rounded-xl p-6 mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Our verdict</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-200 text-sm mb-4">Shortlist the Pinnacle when its bench dimensions, electrical load, foundation, and delivered configuration fit the project. Do not buy it from the capacity label or sale price alone. The strongest next step is to compare a written total-project budget against one longer barrel and one insulated cabin alternative.</p>
      <SelectSaunasButton href={pinnacleUrl} label="Check the current configuration" ctaPosition="review_verdict" />
    </div>

    <PlannerCTA
      source="pinnacle_review_article_footer"
      heading="Turn the product choice into a complete project brief"
      description="Capture the site, budget, electrical readiness, delivery constraints, and timeline before you ask a retailer or installer for a quote."
    />

    <section class="mt-12 border-t border-stone-200 pt-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-stone-900">Sources checked</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="https://almostheaven.com/products/pinnacle-4-person-barrel-sauna" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Almost Heaven: current Pinnacle product page and construction manual</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://almostheaven.com/pages/customer-support" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Almost Heaven: customer support and sauna-room warranty summary</a></li>
        <li><a href={pinnacleUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Select Saunas: current authorized-retailer listing</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-4">Product configurations, availability, pricing, and warranty terms can change. Recheck the current manufacturer documents before purchase.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-stone-900">Compare the project, not just the shell</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="/guides/best-barrel-sauna-kits/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Compare current barrel-sauna options</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/outdoor-sauna-cost/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Build a complete installed-cost range</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/barrel-sauna-vs-cabin-sauna/" class="text-amber-700 hover:underline">Decide between a barrel and a cabin</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
